.SH "نام (NAME)"
cvslastlog \- Prints the log entry for the last commit for a file\&.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBcvslastlog\fR\ 'u
\fBcvslastlog\fR [\fB\fIfilename\fR\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBcvslastlog\fR
shows the log associated with the last CVS commit for the given file\&. It depends on the version of the local file, not the one on the server\&.
.PP
This utility is part of the
KDE
Software Development Kit\&.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
\fBBen Burton\fR <\&\&>
